{"metaDescription":"","name":"Letter Form","metaTitle":"Letter Form","mobile":"","content":"<div class=\"account-page\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"accountletterforms\">\r\n            <div class=\"container\">\r\n                <h1>Letter forms</h1>\r\n                <section class=\"documents\">\r\n                    <div class=\"container\">\r\n                        <div class=\"intro\"><p>Internet shopping - is usefull, time and funds saving process, but it has small gaps which can be covered with pre-set letters bellow. You can change small details and and will have a letter ready to send to merchant.</p></div>\r\n                <section class=\"documents\">\r\n                        <div class=\"documents-list\">\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Trucking Number Request</div>\r\n                                    <p>Sometimes the store does not send the parcel Trucking number, which is necessary for the declaration.</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Missing item from the order</div>\r\n                                    <p>Rarely, but sometimes it happens, order is missing some item. this form can help solve this problem.</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Where is my parcel?</div>\r\n                                    <p>In order of deley of your parcel, use this form to send letter to merchant. Alway check delivery time before buying goods.</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Error in order</div>\r\n                                    <p>In case the package contains a goods mistakly, please immediately contact the merchant.</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Canceling order</div>\r\n                                    <p>If for some reason you decide to cancel your order, here you can find ready-made letter to Merchant.</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n                            <div class=\"item\">\r\n                                <i class=\"icon icon-doc\"></i>\r\n                                <div class=\"item-r\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"title\">Request the Refund</div>\r\n                                    <p>Sometimes buyer or seller cancels an order and is necessary to request refund. Here is a letter...</p>\r\n                                    <div class=\"links\">\r\n                                        <a href=\"\">View</a> <a href=\"\">Download</a>\r\n                                    </div>\r\n                                </div>\r\n                            </div>\r\n\r\n                        </div>\r\n                </section>\r\n            </div>\r\n        </section>\r\n    </div>","header":"","id":80,"groups":[],"url":"/letterform.html","metaKeywords":"","type":1}